  "product_info": {
    "title": "Bose QuietComfort Ultra Wireless Headphones",
    "description": "Immerse yourself in pure sound with the <b>Bose QuietComfort Ultra Wireless Noise Cancelling Over-Ear Headphones</b>. Engineered with </b>Bose Immersive Audio</b> and <b>CustomTune technology</b>, these premium headphones deliver spatial, natural sound that adapts perfectly to your ears. Enjoy <b>world-class noise cancellation, long-lasting comfort</b>, and <b>up to 24 hours of battery life</b> ideal for travel, work, or relaxation. Designed for modern audiophiles, the QuietComfort Ultra offers <b>Bluetooth 5.3 connectivity, touch controls</b>, and <b>multi-mode listening</b> options for total control over your experience. Whether you’re on a call, commuting, or unwinding with your favorite playlist, these headphones redefine what it means to truly listen.",
